OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPlenty of sunshine around to
OL,6,Fstart on Wednesday. Still feeling
OL,7,Fmild, with cloud building through the
OL,8,Fmorning leaving sunny spells by the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Winds strengthening again
OL,10,Fwith the strongest gusts over the
OL,11,Fhills.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRemaining windy this evening
OL,14,Fbut staying dry with cloud building
OL,15,Finto the night to give occasional
OL,16,Fclear spells. A very mild night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
