OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FLargely cloudy and rather
OL,6,Fwindy with rain edging into the far
OL,7,Fnorthwest by the evening. Very mild
OL,8,Fand feeling unseasonably warm in any
OL,9,Fbrightness.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain on
OL,12,FThursday night, then breezy and colder
OL,13,Fon Friday with sunny spells and
OL,14,Fpossible showers. Settled and largely
OL,15,Fdry thereafter with some sunshine and
OL,16,Fcold, locally frosty nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
